WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.852
In the fifteenth century,

2
00:00:01.852 --> 00:00:04.052
poet-saints questioned both temple and

3
00:00:04.052 --> 00:00:05.860
mosque. They sang of a

4
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.311
formless God.

5
00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:10.408
Kabir, the weaver-poet of Banaras.

6
00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:12.091
And Guru Nanak,

7
00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:13.597
born in 1469,

8
00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:16.352
